<div class="Story">
    <div class="Story-section">
        <h4 class="Story-title">One error, on a visible field</h4>
        <p class="Story-label">
            Nothing is drawn: the message already reads under the field itself, and saying it
            twice would be worse than saying it once. The component still renders its host, which
            is what moves the focus — hence an empty frame below.
        </p>
        <div class="Story-stage Story-stage--narrow">
            <twig:Molecules:FormErrors:Base :sampleEntries="[
                {label: 'Email address', message: 'This value is not a valid email address.', target: 'story-email', hidden: false}
            ]" />
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="Story-section">
        <h4 class="Story-title">Three errors, one of them on a field with no place to show it</h4>
        <p class="Story-label">
            Each label links to its field. The third has no label and no link: a hidden field
            cannot be reached, so the summary is the only place its message is ever read. The
            links lead nowhere here, the fields they name belonging to a form this page has not.
        </p>
        <div class="Story-stage Story-stage--narrow">
            <twig:Molecules:FormErrors:Base :sampleEntries="[
                {label: 'Email address', message: 'This value should not be blank.', target: 'story-email', hidden: false},
                {label: 'Password', message: 'This value should not be blank.', target: 'story-password', hidden: false},
                {label: null, message: 'The captcha is invalid.', target: null, hidden: true}
            ]" />
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="Story-section">
        <h4 class="Story-title">One error, on a field with no place to show it</h4>
        <p class="Story-label">
            A single error still gets a summary here, for want of anywhere else to appear.
        </p>
        <div class="Story-stage Story-stage--narrow">
            <twig:Molecules:FormErrors:Base :sampleEntries="[
                {label: null, message: 'The captcha is invalid.', target: null, hidden: true}
            ]" />
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
